sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Operator
  participant UI as Back Office
  participant API as Import API
  participant DB as SQL Server

  U->>UI: Paste menu text
  UI->>API: POST import (bounded text)
  API->>DB: Acquire import-session lease and persist parsed session
  DB-->>API: Session revision and expiry
  API-->>UI: Parsed inventory and review questions
  U->>UI: Resolve all items, choose destination, confirm
  UI->>API: Confirm (session revision, target revision, idempotency key)
  API->>DB: Begin transaction and lock session plus target menu
  API->>DB: Recheck lease, permissions, ceilings, and revisions

  alt Valid and unchanged
    API->>DB: Create or replace all working rows
    API->>DB: Write idempotent commit record
    DB-->>API: Commit with menu ID
    API-->>UI: Import complete with menu ID and counts
    UI-->>U: Show Not live yet, then choose builder or done
  else Conflict or refusal
    API->>DB: Roll back all changes
    DB-->>API: Named refusal or current revision
    API-->>UI: Keep input and require refresh or correction
  end
